      "note": "All 22 explanatory controls expose specific accessible names; the playground remains contained at 390px."
    }
  },
  "ownerFeedback": {
    "decision": "delegated",
    "note": "The owner explicitly delegated final judgment for the responsive remediation wave; the existing playground visual language was preserved."
